 highlighter-rouge">structures</code> property.</p>

<p>The value <em class="rfc">must</em> be an array of <abbr title="JavaScript Object Notation">JSON</abbr> objects. Each item <em class="rfc">must</em> have the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">id</code> and <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">type</code> properties, and the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">type</code> <em class="rfc">must</em> be <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Range</code>.</p>

<ul>
  <li>A Manifest <em class="rfc">may</em> have the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">structures</code> property.<br />
Clients <em class="rfc">should</em> process <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">structures</code> on a Manifest. The first hierarchy <em class="rfc">should</em> be presented to the user by default, and further hierarchies <em class="rfc">should</em> be able to be selected as alternative structures by the user.</li>
  <li>Other types of resource <em class="rfc">must not</em> have the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">structures</code> property.<br />
Clients <em class="rfc">should</em> ignore <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">structures</code> on other types of resource.</li>
</ul>

