      <h3 id="35-values">
        
        
          3.5. Values <a href="#35-values" class="anchorClass"></a>
        
        
      </h3>
    
      <h5 id="values-for-motivation">
        
        
          Values for motivation <a href="#values-for-motivation" class="anchorClass"></a>
        
        
      </h5>
    

<p>This specification defines two values for the Web Annotation property of <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">motivation</code>, or <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">purpose</code> when used on a Specific Resource or Textual Body.</p>

<p>While any resource <em class="rfc">may</em> be the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">target</code> of an Annotation, this specification defines only motivations for Annotations that target Canvases. These motivations allow clients to determine how the Annotation should be rendered, by distinguishing between Annotations that provide the content of the Canvas, from ones with externally defined motivations which are typically comments about the Canvas.</p>

<p>Additional motivations may be added to the Annotation to further clarify the intent, drawn from <a href="/api/presentation/3.0/#46-linked-data-context-and-extensions" title="Linked Data Context and Extensions">extensions</a> or other sources. Clients <em class="rfc">must</em> ig